~ start
if Global.has_met_friend == false
	Player: Are you going to come in with me?
	Friend: I don't know, this place is kind of creeping me out.
	Player: I'll go check to see if they're open. I'll be right back, okay?
	Friend: Yeah, I'll wait in the car. 
	set Global.has_met_friend = true
else
	Friend: Something else you need?
=> END